{"sections":[{"slug":"遍历理论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"遍历理论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">遍历理论</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“遍历理论”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">便利理论是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/统计物理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">统计物理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的力学基础</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它解释了从力学规律过渡到统计规律的过程</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">遍历假设是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/统计物理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">统计物理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">假设之一</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即在足够长时间内</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">系统的代表点将会在系统的能量曲面</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">相空间中的超曲面</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">上各个区域停留相同的时间</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}